# Netlify reads this file for redirects.
#
# The scouting app used to be served from this site at /scout/, before it
# moved to its own subdomain. Two real files still live in public/scout/:
# index.html, which forwards to the new app, and sw.js, which retires the old
# copy's service worker on phones that installed it (see the comment in that
# file). Netlify serves an existing file in preference to a rule here, so
# those two keep working; anything else under /scout/ is sent on directly.
# 301 = permanent.
/scout      https://scouting.bubblotics.ca/          301
/scout/*    https://scouting.bubblotics.ca/:splat    301
